CATEGORIES:trail-work
DESCRIPTION:Join Pisgah Area SORBA for a Trail Work Day! We're excited to 
 join forces with our local NICA Team\, the Pisgah Rage\, as we work togeth
 er to maintain and improve the trails we all love. No experience is necess
 ary—our crew leaders will provide tools\, guidance\, and instruction. Me
 eting Location: Ledford Parking Lot in Bent Creek Meeting Time: 9:00am - n
 oon (please arrive at 8:50am\, TCLs will arrive at 8:30) What to Bring: Lo
 ng pants\, boots that cover your ankles\, gloves (if you have them)\, wate
 r\, snacks\, hardhat (if you have it -bike helmets DO NOT count\, but clim
 bing helmets do)\, safety glasses (if you have them). Note: Hardhats\, glo
 ves and safety glasses can be provided if needed. All tools will be provid
 ed. Please arrive at 8:50am for a timely start to our trail work day!\n\nM
 ore: https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/\n\nSource: Pisgah Area SORBA\n\nList
 ed by Altar Cycles — altar.bike/calendar
LOCATION:Ledford Parking Lot
URL:https://www.pisgahareasorba.org/
END:VEVENT
